cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite it as below."
title: "AlphaLuck: Trading versus Holding in a Live Language-Model Competition"
abstract: >-
  Data and code for trading-versus-holding comparisons in Alpha Arena,
  AI-Trader and Prediction Arena. The repository includes independently reconciled
  Prediction Arena transactions and valuation checks, corrected Alpha Arena
  funding alignment, and formation-threshold sensitivity calculations.
  It also provides arm-deletion and model-block comparisons, cash closing
  costs and cash formation-time sweeps. The comparisons are descriptive and do not establish persistent model skill.
type: software
